---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import WorkCards from '../../components/WorkCards.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Work · Pascal Rhee" description="Public projects and experiments by Pascal Rhee, built with Astro and Cloudflare Workers." section="projects">
  <header class="page-head"><p class="eyebrow">Selected public work</p><h1 class="display">Made to learn.<br /><em>Built to work.</em></h1><p class="lede">A growing collection of personal projects and small technical experiments. The source is open, and the work keeps evolving.</p></header>
  <section class="page-section"><h2 class="sr-only">Public projects</h2><WorkCards /></section>
  <section class="page-section detail-grid" aria-label="Project details">
    <article class="detail" id="personal-site"><p class="section-label">01 / Personal website</p><h2 class="detail-title">One small home base.</h2><p>This site brings writing and projects into a single, deliberately lightweight place. Astro generates static HTML; Cloudflare Workers serves the assets from the edge.</p><p>Shared layouts keep the pages consistent. Responsive CSS, semantic markup, and a mostly static interface keep the experience simple across devices.</p><div class="pill-row"><span>Astro</span><span>HTML & CSS</span><span>Cloudflare Workers</span></div><p><a href="https://github.com/pascalrhee/pascalrhee.com">Explore the source <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></p></article>
    <article class="detail" id="edge-counter"><p class="section-label">02 / Edge-side experiment</p><h2 class="detail-title">A rolling view counter.</h2><p>A small API counts page loads in hourly buckets, with a 30-hour time to live. A read endpoint adds the latest 24 buckets into a rolling total.</p><p>It’s an experiment in keeping a small dynamic feature beside a static site. The illustration above is a schematic, not live traffic data. The API remains part of the project; this redesign keeps visitor counts out of the interface.</p><div class="pill-row"><span>TypeScript</span><span>Workers KV</span><span>REST API</span></div><p><a href="https://github.com/pascalrhee/pascalrhee.com/blob/main/src/worker/index.ts">Read the implementation <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></p></article>
  </section>
  <section class="contact-panel"><div><h2>The professional side of the story.</h2><p>My background spans applied AI, commercial operations, and product.</p></div><a class="button" href="/about/">About my work <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></section>
</BaseLayout>
